    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_03",
      "hash64": "024F7D020AA59DE8",
      "text": "Je te tire mon chapeau ! C’est fantastique !\\nJ’ai eu raison de t’inviter à venir ici ![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_04",
      "hash64": "024F84020AA5A9CD",
      "text": "À ce propos, cela fait un petit moment que tu es\\nparmi nous. Que penses-tu de mon institut ?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_select_01",
      "hash64": "FF16CF5FB1524138",
      "text": "Je m’y amuse bien !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_select_02",
      "hash64": "FF16D25FB1524651",
      "text": "Ce n’est pas mal.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_05",
      "hash64": "024F83020AA5A81A",
      "text": "Voilà qui fait plaisir à entendre ! D’ailleurs,\\nj’ai une proposition qui devrait te plaire ![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_06",
      "hash64": "024F82020AA5A667",
      "text": "Tu n’oses pas le dire, mais tu penses que c’est\\nla meilleure école du monde, n’est-ce pas ?\\c\\nNon, n’en dis pas plus et écoute plutôt ce que\\nj’ai à te proposer ![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 162,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_07",
      "hash64": "024F81020AA5A4B4",
      "text": "Je pense que tu es la personne idéale pour\\nla tâche que je veux te confier.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_08",
      "hash64": "024F78020AA59569",
      "text": "En effet, ta présence a apporté beaucoup de vie\\nà l’ensemble de mon institut ![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_09",
      "hash64": "024F77020AA593B6",
      "text": "Alors, je me suis dit que ce serait une bonne idée\\nd’inviter encore plus de personnes de Paldea\\r\\nen tant qu’[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]intervenantes et intervenants spéciaux[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] ![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
