        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 152,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 158,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_10",
      "hash64": "024BFA020AA28978",
      "text": "Tu connais du monde, n’est-ce pas ? Tu m’as tout\\nl’air d’avoir un réseau solide de connaissances.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_event_tutorial_headbb_11",
      "hash64": "024BFB020AA28B2B",
      "text": "Des Champions et Championnes, des personnes\\ndu corps enseignant... Invite qui tu veux !\\c\\nTu peux même appeler tes camarades, si tu le\\ndésires ! Nul doute qu’ils excellent en combat ![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
